Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish If you want it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,gotta go over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing. No time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.52,0:00:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:00:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're closed, I\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.92,0:01:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Marks maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.30,0:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead at new horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,In view shining brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who knows what's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.28,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you've got to make your mark today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Gloom Island,\Nlocated on the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.42,0:02:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Straw Hats were separated for\Ntwo years, Zoro trained himself here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.02,0:02:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In an old castle near a\Nlake in this fallen country,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,an enigmatic man passes his days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.56,0:02:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a member of the\NSeven Warlords of the Sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and said to be the strongest\Nswordsman in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.50,0:02:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Dracule Mihawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Moria? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.74,0:03:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.65,0:03:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,not dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.64,0:03:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gecko, Moria and his zombie\Narmy are on the prowl again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.84,0:03:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Moria's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,On the brawl, they said!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.36,0:03:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look, it's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his big, dumb, wonderful face!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I read the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why didn't you tell me? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.76,0:03:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Moria's very important to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care. You should!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my captain, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought for sure he died\Nin Marineford two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.22,0:03:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.24,0:03:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mori is alive, maybe he\Ngot the gang back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.92,0:03:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and he's already with\NHogback and Absalom too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Horororo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.70,0:04:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I should thank him\Nfor letting me stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I wanted to come\Nto this kingdom exactly,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma sent me flying here\Nfrom thriller. Bark!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.66,0:04:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,After that fight with the Straw Hats,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've just been hanging out\Nfor two years, if nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Moria is persistent\Nlike a horde of zombies;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,he employs, say, what\Nyou dare insult Moria?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.62,0:04:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ungrateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.59,0:04:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe him nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten all those\Ntimes that I cooked for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You cooked, yes, but I cooked more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I helped you\Nwith farming stuff, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.58,0:04:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And I gave you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,a place to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.48,0:04:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the least new thing in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.74,0:04:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.94,0:04:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not mad, I'm not mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.64,0:05:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be nice! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to storm off here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Fionn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You did so much for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.92,0:05:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Noisy to the end, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.44,0:05:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.35,0:05:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Considering the circumstances,\Nnow may be a good time to depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The reverie is in session\Nat Marie Joie, as you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:05:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They brought up a troubling subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There is Absalom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.96,0:06:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Break him to me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I shot them, but they just won't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.72,0:07:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me where Absalom is or else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.10,0:07:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You stupid underlings are useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, have it your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't want to deal with me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.26,0:07:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me where to find Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.06,0:07:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't listening to me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me Blackbeard or\Nyou're going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.06,0:07:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna drag you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:07:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbird!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Awful noisy, Meowth, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.28,0:08:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Pizarro, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Gecko Moria!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The former warlord of the sea! Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you let him in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke in, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,With his zombie army!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.02,0:08:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The port is completely destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what he's looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems he wants to see Commodore teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.34,0:08:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's looking for his old Gourmet Absalom,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.72,0:08:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that invisible guy who\Nwas here the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.96,0:08:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see you, chumps,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,really aren't working with me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.26,0:08:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I won't break in there\Nand wreck you, Maria over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.60,0:08:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy you made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.04,0:08:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Absalom, is that really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.60,0:08:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.54,0:08:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In the flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.60,0:08:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.24,0:08:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you might be\Ndead! Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.46,0:08:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never felt better!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard a thing about\Nyou since we all split up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.40,0:09:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You were making me nervous!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.30,0:09:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about that, boss, but\Nthis place is a party every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.56,0:09:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost track of time having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.18,0:09:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to reach out to you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's all it is, I'm\Njust happy to have you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.84,0:09:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I went a little overboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.90,0:09:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, zombies—that's enough\Nchaos—go back to the ship I.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.76,0:09:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,ship I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Blackbeard\Nmight have nabbed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,His crew hunts down people with powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.00,0:09:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone got your clear clear\Nfruit, we'd be in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.52,0:09:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Invisibility is a useful power to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.72,0:10:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It can be very deadly in the right hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, I know that very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.90,0:10:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.14,0:10:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.70,0:10:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Who caught me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.08,0:10:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on and fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.88,0:10:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiryu, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You worked at Impel Down,\Nbut joined up with Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Close enough, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.46,0:11:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how do you like my new power?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You were invisible, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.84,0:11:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have Absalom's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.32,0:11:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, but it is, Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My thanks to your old Gourmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.76,0:11:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This will prove quite useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.12,0:11:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's not Absalom up\Nthere, who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.84,0:11:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Maroon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.64,0:12:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Devon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.06,0:12:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me, what did you do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.12,0:12:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Absalom waltzed into our home with a\Nchip on his shoulder, so we shoved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.38,0:12:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But his body is here, if you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.72,0:12:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You love a good corpse, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.70,0:12:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make every last one of you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He was my Gourmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.80,0:12:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He was my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You say I love corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all gonna be corpses\Nwhen I'm done with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.14,0:13:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, if you want to try, be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.86,0:13:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't have you disturbing\Nthe peace here on Pirate Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.84,0:13:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize that voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I'll see you there myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.28,0:13:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I'll pass, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.94,0:13:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at my leisure now, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.08,0:13:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a pirate's paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.94,0:13:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That means it ought to be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You've picked enough fights today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.24,0:13:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to party!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you'd like to party,\Nyou're welcome on my ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.54,0:14:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Moria, you like to party, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.54,0:14:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.02,0:14:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So did you happen to read the newspaper\Ntoday? There's never a dull moment lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.96,0:14:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,on the fourth day of reverie the\Ncaptains of the revolutionary army
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:15:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Made their move. They risked it all to\Ntake back Kuma. Bustling into Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.56,0:15:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,juan facing off with two navy\Nadmirals rio kugyu and Fujitora must
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.78,0:15:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,have been a sight and that's not the\Nhalf of it there's also something
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,going down the land of wano where\Nthe monster kaido lives Straw Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's been a lot of talk\Nlately, is there? along with a whole
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.66,0:15:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,slew of hot-blooded punks and hot\Non his tail is another emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.54,0:15:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,angry as a wet head crazy old big
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.78,0:15:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,mom what do you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.22,0:15:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,think will happen next
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the beginning of\Nthe end. You tough guys all
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.34,0:15:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,seem to want the throne but\Nthere can only be one king
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.00,0:16:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,guitar solo
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.28,0:18:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.56,0:18:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's as strong as Duke Dog's turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just as quick and\Njust as hard-headed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand, Assure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.32,0:18:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You Gar are wasting this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.46,0:18:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Use it to fight to protect the\Npeople of Kuri that Lord Odin loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.94,0:18:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Odin is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come back after all these\Nyears when the country has gone to hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.74,0:18:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to accomplish\NLord Odin's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream that Ugar abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:19:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And now Ugar are selfishly wielding\Nyour sword as your people suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.54,0:19:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.20,0:19:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You speak as if you're so\Nwise, but you aren't even here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.06,0:19:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something you've\Ngot to want to say, say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.02,0:19:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck fire style, fire willow black!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.44,0:19:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough. I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.84,0:19:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Doug Storm!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.86,0:19:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ashura!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.60,0:19:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were better than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.66,0:19:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.24,0:20:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I have watched the land of Wano for the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,past two decades since\NLord Odin's sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You all show up like no time has passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.16,0:20:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no obligation to listen. Now leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,since I'm such a scoundrel, you should be\Ngrateful I don't rob you on your way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you all forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.24,0:20:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is who we were before\NLord Oden changed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden was a man among men.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.62,0:20:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,One who I would proudly risk\Nmy life for as a samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.18,0:20:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the only one I served.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.94,0:20:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not bow to the Kozuki clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.96,0:20:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe this country nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.04,0:20:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a scoundrel, as you say, myself,\Nbut I have not abandoned my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.42,0:21:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You will join Ashida.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.56,0:21:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Of that I will make certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.32,0:21:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You honestly think this country\Nwill welcome the Kozuki clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.64,0:21:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe your foolish arrogance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You abandoned our home for 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.86,0:21:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't compensate for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.72,0:21:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All that we've lost won't return.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.18,0:21:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yutia aren't injured. I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.48,0:21:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.80,0:21:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon the interruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.90,0:21:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Race?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.12,0:21:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to ascertain\Nthe location of Sir Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.64,0:22:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's confined at the\Nexcavation labor camp in Udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.10,0:22:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.28,0:22:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you are the most\Nsuited to deal with this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.62,0:22:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Say no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.32,0:22:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Otama, please say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.44,0:22:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.12,0:22:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.10,0:22:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you suffered a\Nvicious attack from Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.26,0:22:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, these fine doctors found\Nyou and brought you here to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.84,0:22:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.92,0:22:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you all very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.02,0:22:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I am in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.78,0:22:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, you weren't hurt bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.80,0:22:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be better real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.46,0:22:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.94,0:22:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.52,0:22:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh, remember I got scared\Nand passed out right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.80,0:22:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So I don't really know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.84,0:22:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Or why someone like Kaido\Nwould attack me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.18,0:22:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can remember is that Horselina\Nfought super hard to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.64,0:23:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Master, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.62,0:23:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So you, Karoo, have the power to\Nturn your enemies into allies?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.14,0:23:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be very handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.28,0:23:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happened to Horselina?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.18,0:23:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And where is Big Bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.64,0:23:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we didn't\Nsee anyone named Horselina.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.46,0:23:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And Luffy was...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.14,0:23:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bro got smashed by Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And now he's stuck at the camp in Udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.44,0:23:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.82,0:23:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you're still injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.10,0:23:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.30,0:23:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm way more worried about Big\NBro Luffy than some scratches.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.68,0:23:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.84,0:23:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Our captain always pulls\Nthrough, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.78,0:23:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Udang is one of several\Nregions in the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.02,0:23:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.93,0:23:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,under the current regime,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.04,0:24:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,most of its inhabitants are criminals,\Ncondemned to the excavation labor camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.20,0:24:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido's lucrative weapons trade is\Nbolstered by the slave labor in these mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.62,0:24:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dreadful place where the prisoners\Nare forced to work until they die,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.32,0:24:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,with no hope of escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.56,0:24:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.44,0:24:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we don't require geisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.06,0:24:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not let anyone approach this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.08,0:24:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.54,0:25:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What a wicked fellow you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.90,0:25:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the order sheet for the\Nnext round of armor and weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.98,0:25:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,as wicked as they come, huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.40,0:25:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose, my—that's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.62,0:25:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone has a war on the horizon, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.30,0:25:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't concern myself with\Nwhat happens abroad, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.24,0:25:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That make what they want\Nand don't ask questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.82,0:25:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes are
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.80,0:25:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,too aged—you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.71,0:25:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,must watch them in my stead!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.90,0:25:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay calm, remain quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.02,0:25:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Above all else!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.28,0:25:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid heads
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.30,0:25:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.46,0:25:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the way
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.38,0:26:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.06,0:26:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Go up in the attic and get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.42,0:26:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop them at any cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.66,0:26:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.70,0:26:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take some deep breaths!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.24,0:26:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.66,0:26:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to stop screaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.84,0:26:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.86,0:26:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.02,0:26:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.22,0:26:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is it just a cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.06,0:26:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.78,0:26:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.38,0:26:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.30,0:26:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.62,0:26:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Ah! Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.78,0:26:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.56,0:27:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.94,0:27:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to freak out like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.48,0:27:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.08,0:27:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.50,0:27:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something that\NI should have told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.22,0:27:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Find them!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.68,0:27:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep looking around!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.38,0:27:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the intruders escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.44,0:28:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.08,0:28:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a fear of sharp objects!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.34,0:28:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how are you a ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.40,0:28:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.38,0:28:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A mature woman is as
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.32,0:28:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,deadly as any weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.22,0:28:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A fine wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.44,0:28:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.80,0:28:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninpo, great kite!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.66,0:28:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu, you can fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.22,0:29:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you found them, you fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.58,0:29:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you happen to acquire any intel?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.68,0:29:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.94,0:29:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I saw the\Nshipment's place and date.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.14,0:29:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Onami.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.40,0:29:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take us straight to a stockpile of\Nweapons and armor, right for the taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.46,0:29:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, what's the hustle and bustle\Nabout? That's one heck of a line?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.56,0:29:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be a sale. Seems\Nlike mostly young ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.30,0:29:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome one, welcome all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.58,0:29:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh Sabo coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.54,0:29:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, next one's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.10,0:29:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.66,0:30:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec. Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.86,0:30:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's firm, but tender.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.52,0:30:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet, savory, and oh-so-juicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.84,0:30:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the third son of five children.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.88,0:30:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My soba's too delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.46,0:30:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.40,0:30:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, five, two, eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.78,0:30:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And the sum is 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.70,0:30:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's today's special.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.50,0:30:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The noodles are shining!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.48,0:30:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They really melt in your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.78,0:30:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.76,0:30:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to recruit Samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.72,0:30:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.38,0:30:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.50,0:30:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a tale of terror!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.88,0:30:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Castle apparitions are\Nabout spreading a curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.68,0:31:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't miss our special\Nedition covering the
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.68,0:31:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,ghost sightings in the northern graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.94,0:31:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all the hubbub about?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.98,0:31:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to go look.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.44,0:31:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitokiri Kamazo
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.62,0:31:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.90,0:31:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,His wicked grin is the\Nlast thing you'll ever
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.54,0:31:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,see He cuts down any\Npoor fool in his path.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.16,0:31:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is he, and what does he want?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.10,0:31:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That one took out my husband!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.20,0:31:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.42,0:31:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, perk up your ears for this one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.36,0:31:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you heard the tale of Ushimitsu Koza?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.84,0:31:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He appears at the witching\Nhour to rob from the rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.58,0:31:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But this benevolent bandit shares his\Nill-gotten kings with those less fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.96,0:32:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Or so they say, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.68,0:32:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he an agent of justice,\Nor just an agent of chaos?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.50,0:32:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could he be and what's his next target
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.18,0:32:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,don't be the last to know\Npick up a paper today?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.20,0:32:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to miss this\Nstory get it while it's hot
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.64,0:32:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,or get left in the dust you\Ndon't have to ask me twice
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.62,0:32:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The reversed crescent moon?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.74,0:32:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who gave me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.92,0:33:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Have they truly returned?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.90,0:33:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.84,0:33:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it's just those ghosts\Nthat people keep seeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.30,0:33:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We've kept the faith for this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.02,0:33:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for action.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.90,0:34:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.12,0:34:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, it's been too long, I fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.78,0:34:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years ago, I would\Nhave been itching to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.48,0:34:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond that, where are they\Ngoing to get their weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.94,0:34:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Only samurai can carry a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.30,0:34:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Citizens are all defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.94,0:34:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the training halls\Nhave been shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.58,0:34:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Karate, judo, and every last\Nweapon has been banned here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.10,0:34:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi has eliminated any\Nchance we'd have to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.82,0:34:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll beat them with my fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.16,0:34:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.32,0:34:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting so long to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.38,0:34:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.80,0:34:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.12,0:34:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My whole body is shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.22,0:35:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.34,0:35:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Raizo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.46,0:35:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.54,0:35:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.00,0:35:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No friend, it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.36,0:35:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I bring tidings from the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.36,0:35:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Otama has made a full recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.70,0:35:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall return. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.98,0:35:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Jack, these offerings from\NCootie aren't gonna cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.58,0:36:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo isn't around anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.46,0:36:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You know who our next business\Npartner's gonna be, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.92,0:36:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.14,0:36:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need more dead\Nweight around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.14,0:36:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We already have Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.90,0:36:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.92,0:36:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need any more Sexy\Nwhen we already have King.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.54,0:36:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack the Stooge, you are on thin ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.22,0:36:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't act so tough\Nif I were you, queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.38,0:36:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have those punks\Nbegging for mercy by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.56,0:36:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.56,0:36:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna be running that prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.14,0:36:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't accept\Ncriticism from perverts.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.06,0:36:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
